 ind←GetTableRows(row markdown);noOf1;noOf2;lengths
 lengths←≢¨markdown~¨' '                ⍝ Because empty rows define beginning and end of the table
 noOf1←+/∧\0<⌽row↑lengths               ⍝ No of table rows including and above cursor
 noOf1←+/∧\⌽'|'∊¨(-noOf1)↑row↑markdown  ⍝ Corrections: of those, only the ones carrying a pipe
 noOf2←+/∧\0<row↓lengths                ⍝ No of table rows below cursor
 noOf2←+/∧\'|'∊¨noOf2↑row↓markdown      ⍝ Corrections: of those, only the ones carrying a pipe
 ind←(row-noOf1)+⍳noOf1+noOf2           ⍝ Index of the table
 ind/⍨←'|'∊¨markdown[ind]
⍝Done
